[
 {
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 0.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Imagine waking up tomorrow, and every person you see has a number floating above their head.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 3.383,
  "chunk": 0,
  "pause_after": 0.343
 },
 {
  "text": "Not their age.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 3.727,
  "end": 4.336,
  "chunk": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Not their salary.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 4.336,
  "end": 4.945,
  "chunk": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Their body count.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 4.945,
  "end": 5.554,
  "chunk": 1,
  "pause_after": 0.318
 },
 {
  "text": "The number of people they've been intimate with.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 5.871,
  "end": 7.722,
  "chunk": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "Your date.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 7.722,
  "end": 8.185,
  "chunk": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "Your boss.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 8.185,
  "end": 8.648,
  "chunk": 2,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "Your best friend.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 8.861,
  "end": 9.713,
  "chunk": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "The stranger on the train.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 9.713,
  "end": 11.135,
  "chunk": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "Everyone can see everyone's.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 11.135,
  "end": 12.272,
  "chunk": 3,
  "pause_after": 0.208
 },
 {
  "text": "Nobody can hide it.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 12.48,
  "end": 13.491,
  "chunk": 4,
  "pause_after": 1.167
 },
 {
  "text": "What would the world do with that number?",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 14.658,
  "end": 15.99,
  "chunk": 5,
  "pause_after": 0.585
 },
 {
  "text": "Let's find out.",
  "section": "THE NUMBER",
  "start": 16.575,
  "end": 17.301,
  "chunk": 6,
  "pause_after": 0.71
 },
 {
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 18.012
 },
 {
  "text": "First, the rules.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 18.012,
  "end": 18.583,
  "chunk": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "The number is exact.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 18.583,
  "end": 19.344,
  "chunk": 7,
  "pause_after": 0.338
 },
 {
  "text": "It counts everyone, however you'd define it, and it never goes down.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 19.682,
  "end": 21.969,
  "chunk": 8,
  "pause_after": 0.327
 },
 {
  "text": "It's visible to all, all the time.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 22.296,
  "end": 23.685,
  "chunk": 9,
  "pause_after": 0.415
 },
 {
  "text": "So, what's the first thing people would do?",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 24.099,
  "end": 25.865,
  "chunk": 10,
  "pause_after": 0.672
 },
 {
  "text": "They'd look.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 26.537,
  "end": 27.109,
  "chunk": 11,
  "pause_after": 0.446
 },
 {
  "text": "And then, in total silence, they'd look at their own.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 27.555,
  "end": 29.276,
  "chunk": 12,
  "pause_after": 0.627
 },
 {
  "text": "But before anyone can trust the number, there's a problem.",
  "section": "THE RULES",
  "start": 29.903,
  "end": 31.815,
  "chunk": 13,
  "pause_after": 0.908
 },
 {
  "section": "WHO DECIDES WHAT COUNTS",
  "start": 32.722
 },
 {
  "text": "Researchers who study this point out that people don't agree on what counts.",
  "section": "WHO DECIDES WHAT COUNTS",
  "start": 32.722,
  "end": 35.249,
  "chunk": 14,
  "pause_after": 0.341
 },
 {
  "text": "Ask a hundred people what they'd include, and you get a hundred slightly different answers.",
  "section": "WHO DECIDES WHAT COUNTS",
  "start": 35.59,
  "end": 38.817,
  "chunk": 15,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "So in our story, the number is simply fixed, by magic, and nobody gets to argue.",
  "section": "WHO DECIDES WHAT COUNTS",
  "start": 39.138,
  "end": 43.14,
  "chunk": 16,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "In real life, every survey asks the question, and every person quietly answers a different one.",
  "section": "WHO DECIDES WHAT COUNTS",
  "start": 43.353,
  "end": 48.06,
  "chunk": 17,
  "pause_after": 0.35
 },
 {
  "text": "That means the numbers we have are already shakier than they look.",
  "section": "WHO DECIDES WHAT COUNTS",
  "start": 48.41,
  "end": 50.926,
  "chunk": 18,
  "pause_after": 0.269
 },
 {
  "text": "And that leads to the first surprise.",
  "section": "WHO DECIDES WHAT COUNTS",
  "start": 51.195,
  "end": 52.446,
  "chunk": 19,
  "pause_after": 0.795
 },
 {
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 53.241
 },
 {
  "text": "In surveys, men tend to report more partners than women, even though, on average, the numbers should match.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 53.241,
  "end": 57.273,
  "chunk": 20,
  "pause_after": 0.375
 },
 {
  "text": "Researchers think some people exaggerate, and some people hide.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 57.648,
  "end": 59.894,
  "chunk": 21,
  "pause_after": 0.254
 },
 {
  "text": "In a small study from two thousand three, volunteers were hooked up to a fake lie detector before answering.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 60.147,
  "end": 64.189,
  "chunk": 22,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "Under that pressure, the gap between men's and women's answers almost disappeared.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 64.505,
  "end": 67.916,
  "chunk": 23,
  "pause_after": 0.36
 },
 {
  "text": "It was only a small study, but it hints at something.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 68.276,
  "end": 70.353,
  "chunk": 24,
  "pause_after": 0.416
 },
 {
  "text": "With a visible number, nobody could round up, and nobody could round down.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 70.769,
  "end": 74.105,
  "chunk": 25,
  "pause_after": 0.292
 },
 {
  "text": "Honesty by force.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 74.396,
  "end": 75.359,
  "chunk": 26,
  "pause_after": 0.588
 },
 {
  "text": "But the real shock isn't who was lying.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 75.947,
  "end": 77.397,
  "chunk": 27,
  "pause_after": 0.209
 },
 {
  "text": "It's what the average turns out to be.",
  "section": "THE SURPRISE",
  "start": 77.605,
  "end": 78.753,
  "chunk": 28,
  "pause_after": 1.141
 },
 {
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 79.894
 },
 {
  "text": "Most people assume everyone else has a much bigger number than they do.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 79.894,
  "end": 82.28,
  "chunk": 29,
  "pause_after": 0.393
 },
 {
  "text": "In big U.S.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 82.673,
  "end": 83.641,
  "chunk": 30,
  "pause_after": 0.545
 },
 {
  "text": "surveys, the typical number, the median, has sat at around three to four across generations.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 84.186,
  "end": 88.76,
  "chunk": 31,
  "pause_after": 0.328
 },
 {
  "text": "A handful.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 89.088,
  "end": 89.739,
  "chunk": 32,
  "pause_after": 0.571
 },
 {
  "text": "The average looks higher, because a small group with very large numbers pulls it up.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 90.31,
  "end": 93.222,
  "chunk": 33,
  "pause_after": 0.304
 },
 {
  "text": "Statisticians call that skew.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 93.527,
  "end": 94.791,
  "chunk": 34,
  "pause_after": 0.431
 },
 {
  "text": "And surveys often stop counting at fifty.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 95.222,
  "end": 96.677,
  "chunk": 35,
  "pause_after": 0.342
 },
 {
  "text": "So when the numbers appeared, most people would feel relief.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 97.019,
  "end": 99.05,
  "chunk": 36,
  "pause_after": 0.381
 },
 {
  "text": "Almost everyone is closer to the middle than they thought.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 99.431,
  "end": 102.156,
  "chunk": 37
 },
 {
  "text": "Relief doesn't last long, though.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 102.156,
  "end": 103.518,
  "chunk": 37,
  "pause_after": 0.285
 },
 {
  "text": "Because the number was never really about numbers.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 103.803,
  "end": 105.987,
  "chunk": 38
 },
 {
  "text": "It was about judgment.",
  "section": "THE AVERAGE",
  "start": 105.987,
  "end": 107.079,
  "chunk": 38,
  "pause_after": 0.793
 },
 {
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 107.873
 },
 {
  "text": "Researchers talk about the sexual double standard: the same number can earn one person a high-five, and another person a label.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 107.873,
  "end": 112.76,
  "chunk": 39,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "Studies disagree about how strong it still is today.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 112.997,
  "end": 114.763,
  "chunk": 40,
  "pause_after": 0.565
 },
 {
  "text": "But in a world with visible numbers, gossip would become a scoreboard.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 115.327,
  "end": 117.812,
  "chunk": 41,
  "pause_after": 0.228
 },
 {
  "text": "We already know what happens when a number is public.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 118.04,
  "end": 119.733,
  "chunk": 42,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "In twenty nineteen, Instagram tested hiding like counts, starting in Canada, because people kept comparing themselves to everyone else.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 120.019,
  "end": 125.147,
  "chunk": 43,
  "pause_after": 0.218
 },
 {
  "text": "Later, it made hiding them optional.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 125.365,
  "end": 126.994,
  "chunk": 44
 },
 {
  "text": "Some people found it helpful.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 126.994,
  "end": 128.351,
  "chunk": 44,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "Some still wanted to see.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 128.672,
  "end": 129.603,
  "chunk": 45,
  "pause_after": 0.38
 },
 {
  "text": "A number, once visible, becomes a competition.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 129.983,
  "end": 132.121,
  "chunk": 46
 },
 {
  "text": "Even when nobody entered one.",
  "section": "THE SCARLET NUMBER",
  "start": 132.121,
  "end": 133.648,
  "chunk": 46,
  "pause_after": 0.969
 },
 {
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 134.617
 },
 {
  "text": "We already live with numbers that try to summarise people.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 134.617,
  "end": 136.913,
  "chunk": 47
 },
 {
  "text": "Grades.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 136.913,
  "end": 137.143,
  "chunk": 47,
  "pause_after": 0.279
 },
 {
  "text": "Follower counts.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 137.422,
  "end": 137.972,
  "chunk": 48
 },
 {
  "text": "Credit scores.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 137.972,
  "end": 138.522,
  "chunk": 48,
  "pause_after": 0.411
 },
 {
  "text": "A credit score is a single number that quietly shapes where you can rent and what you can borrow.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 138.932,
  "end": 142.167,
  "chunk": 49,
  "pause_after": 0.239
 },
 {
  "text": "At least it mostly stays private.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 142.406,
  "end": 143.483,
  "chunk": 50,
  "pause_after": 0.251
 },
 {
  "text": "A number about your private life would work the same way, only far more personal, and far easier to misuse.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 143.735,
  "end": 148.126,
  "chunk": 51,
  "pause_after": 0.33
 },
 {
  "text": "And the first place it would show up is dating.",
  "section": "THE NUMBERS WE ALREADY HAVE",
  "start": 148.455,
  "end": 150.367,
  "chunk": 52,
  "pause_after": 0.698
 },
 {
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 151.065
 },
 {
  "text": "Picture the first date in this world.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 151.065,
  "end": 152.389,
  "chunk": 53,
  "pause_after": 0.281
 },
 {
  "text": "Before hello, you've already read their number, and they've read yours.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 152.67,
  "end": 154.983,
  "chunk": 54,
  "pause_after": 0.41
 },
 {
  "text": "Some people would use it as a filter.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 155.393,
  "end": 156.971,
  "chunk": 55
 },
 {
  "text": "Under three, over ten, never mind.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 156.971,
  "end": 158.155,
  "chunk": 55,
  "pause_after": 0.313
 },
 {
  "text": "Some would feel judged before they even spoke.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 158.468,
  "end": 160.041,
  "chunk": 56,
  "pause_after": 0.349
 },
 {
  "text": "And nobody would get to say anything about it.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 160.39,
  "end": 162.151,
  "chunk": 57
 },
 {
  "text": "That's the cruel part.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 162.151,
  "end": 162.934,
  "chunk": 57,
  "pause_after": 0.398
 },
 {
  "text": "Because a number has no story.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 163.332,
  "end": 164.635,
  "chunk": 58,
  "pause_after": 0.392
 },
 {
  "text": "It doesn't say whether someone was in love, or lonely, or young, or brave.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 165.027,
  "end": 168.43,
  "chunk": 59,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "It doesn't say whether they were kind.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 168.717,
  "end": 170.025,
  "chunk": 60,
  "pause_after": 0.223
 },
 {
  "text": "And it definitely doesn't say whether they were faithful.",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 170.248,
  "end": 171.989,
  "chunk": 61,
  "pause_after": 0.214
 },
 {
  "text": "So how useful would it really be?",
  "section": "THE DATING APP",
  "start": 172.202,
  "end": 173.491,
  "chunk": 62,
  "pause_after": 0.911
 },
 {
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 174.402
 },
 {
  "text": "Now it gets worse.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 174.402,
  "end": 175.279,
  "chunk": 63,
  "pause_after": 0.481
 },
 {
  "text": "The number wouldn't stay in the dating world.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 175.76,
  "end": 177.36,
  "chunk": 64
 },
 {
  "text": "It would walk into the office.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 177.36,
  "end": 178.56,
  "chunk": 64,
  "pause_after": 0.2
 },
 {
  "text": "Employers aren't supposed to judge people on their private lives, but a number you can see is a number you can't unsee.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 178.76,
  "end": 183.451,
  "chunk": 65,
  "pause_after": 0.222
 },
 {
  "text": "It would walk into the family.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 183.673,
  "end": 185.309,
  "chunk": 66
 },
 {
  "text": "Awkward dinners.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 185.309,
  "end": 185.854,
  "chunk": 66
 },
 {
  "text": "Quiet looks across the table.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 185.854,
  "end": 187.217,
  "chunk": 66,
  "pause_after": 0.206
 },
 {
  "text": "Different families, and different cultures, would react in very different ways.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 187.422,
  "end": 190.795,
  "chunk": 67,
  "pause_after": 0.335
 },
 {
  "text": "Some would shrug.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 191.13,
  "end": 191.774,
  "chunk": 68
 },
 {
  "text": "Some would never recover.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 191.774,
  "end": 192.631,
  "chunk": 68
 },
 {
  "text": "Friendships would shift.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 192.631,
  "end": 193.274,
  "chunk": 68,
  "pause_after": 0.255
 },
 {
  "text": "Some would deepen, because people finally had something honest to talk about.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 193.53,
  "end": 196.053,
  "chunk": 69,
  "pause_after": 0.28
 },
 {
  "text": "Some would end.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 196.333,
  "end": 196.997,
  "chunk": 70,
  "pause_after": 0.573
 },
 {
  "text": "A single number, rewriting every relationship at once.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 197.569,
  "end": 199.439,
  "chunk": 71
 },
 {
  "text": "But hold on.",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 199.439,
  "end": 200.14,
  "chunk": 71,
  "pause_after": 0.303
 },
 {
  "text": "If the number tells us so little, why do we want it so badly?",
  "section": "WORK AND FAMILY",
  "start": 200.442,
  "end": 203.168,
  "chunk": 72,
  "pause_after": 0.754
 },
 {
  "section": "THE HEALTH QUESTION",
  "start": 203.922
 },
 {
  "text": "There's one thing people might hope a number could tell them.",
  "section": "THE HEALTH QUESTION",
  "start": 203.922,
  "end": 206.231,
  "chunk": 73,
  "pause_after": 0.275
 },
 {
  "text": "Health.",
  "section": "THE HEALTH QUESTION",
  "start": 206.507,
  "end": 206.947,
  "chunk": 74,
  "pause_after": 0.757
 },
 {
  "text": "But doctors and health agencies say that risk depends on protection and testing, not only on how many people someone has been with.",
  "section": "THE HEALTH QUESTION",
  "start": 207.704,
  "end": 212.628,
  "chunk": 75,
  "pause_after": 0.205
 },
 {
  "text": "Someone with a high number who tests regularly can be safer than someone with a low number who never does.",
  "section": "THE HEALTH QUESTION",
  "start": 212.833,
  "end": 216.783,
  "chunk": 76,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "So the number would give people a feeling of information, without the information that matters.",
  "section": "THE HEALTH QUESTION",
  "start": 217.099,
  "end": 220.439,
  "chunk": 77,
  "pause_after": 0.319
 },
 {
  "text": "And there's something about numbers that's even harder to talk about.",
  "section": "THE HEALTH QUESTION",
  "start": 220.758,
  "end": 223.024,
  "chunk": 78,
  "pause_after": 1.104
 },
 {
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 224.128
 },
 {
  "text": "A number can't say which of those were choices.",
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 224.128,
  "end": 225.874,
  "chunk": 79,
  "pause_after": 0.39
 },
 {
  "text": "For some people, the number includes things that were never their choice.",
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 226.264,
  "end": 229.257,
  "chunk": 80,
  "pause_after": 0.257
 },
 {
  "text": "Imagine that number hanging over your head, in public, forever.",
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 229.515,
  "end": 232.29,
  "chunk": 81
 },
 {
  "text": "That's why some things are private.",
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 232.29,
  "end": 233.955,
  "chunk": 81,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "Not because they're shameful.",
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 234.191,
  "end": 235.283,
  "chunk": 82,
  "pause_after": 0.516
 },
 {
  "text": "Because the person who lived them should be the one who tells the story.",
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 235.798,
  "end": 238.144,
  "chunk": 83,
  "pause_after": 0.273
 },
 {
  "text": "So, does any society allow people to know about a partner's past?",
  "section": "WHAT A NUMBER CAN'T SAY",
  "start": 238.416,
  "end": 241.494,
  "chunk": 84,
  "pause_after": 0.887
 },
 {
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 242.381
 },
 {
  "text": "Actually, one does, in a very specific way.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 242.381,
  "end": 243.915,
  "chunk": 85,
  "pause_after": 0.388
 },
 {
  "text": "In England and Wales, since twenty fourteen, people can ask the police about a partner's history of violence or abuse.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 244.303,
  "end": 249.079,
  "chunk": 86,
  "pause_after": 0.38
 },
 {
  "text": "It's called Clare's Law.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 249.459,
  "end": 250.423,
  "chunk": 87,
  "pause_after": 0.461
 },
 {
  "text": "Notice what society chose to make knowable.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 250.884,
  "end": 253.055,
  "chunk": 88
 },
 {
  "text": "Not how many partners.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 253.055,
  "end": 254.295,
  "chunk": 88,
  "pause_after": 0.278
 },
 {
  "text": "Not a score.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 254.573,
  "end": 255.232,
  "chunk": 89
 },
 {
  "text": "Safety.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 255.232,
  "end": 255.452,
  "chunk": 89,
  "pause_after": 0.206
 },
 {
  "text": "That's a very different kind of number.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 255.658,
  "end": 256.876,
  "chunk": 90,
  "pause_after": 0.257
 },
 {
  "text": "One that protects people, instead of ranking them.",
  "section": "THE RIGHT TO ASK",
  "start": 257.133,
  "end": 258.799,
  "chunk": 91,
  "pause_after": 1.064
 },
 {
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 259.863
 },
 {
  "text": "So what happens a year after the numbers appear?",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 259.863,
  "end": 261.734,
  "chunk": 92,
  "pause_after": 0.687
 },
 {
  "text": "Maybe, like most things we see every day, we'd stop looking.",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 262.422,
  "end": 264.96,
  "chunk": 93,
  "pause_after": 0.41
 },
 {
  "text": "Maybe people would learn to ask better questions: Who were you before?",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 265.37,
  "end": 268.686,
  "chunk": 94,
  "pause_after": 0.544
 },
 {
  "text": "What did you learn?",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 269.23,
  "end": 269.941,
  "chunk": 95,
  "pause_after": 0.539
 },
 {
  "text": "What do you want now?",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 270.48,
  "end": 271.306,
  "chunk": 96,
  "pause_after": 0.625
 },
 {
  "text": "Maybe the number would fade into the background, like a follower count.",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 271.931,
  "end": 274.33,
  "chunk": 97,
  "pause_after": 0.385
 },
 {
  "text": "Or maybe it would never stop mattering, and some people would never forgive it.",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 274.715,
  "end": 277.4,
  "chunk": 98,
  "pause_after": 0.344
 },
 {
  "text": "Nobody can say for sure.",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 277.743,
  "end": 278.637,
  "chunk": 99
 },
 {
  "text": "But one thing is clear.",
  "section": "AFTER THE SHOCK",
  "start": 278.637,
  "end": 279.531,
  "chunk": 99,
  "pause_after": 0.706
 },
 {
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 280.237
 },
 {
  "text": "A number is a terrible summary of a person.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 280.237,
  "end": 282.091,
  "chunk": 100,
  "pause_after": 0.4
 },
 {
  "text": "It can't tell you whether someone is honest, kind, careful, or ready.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 282.491,
  "end": 285.29,
  "chunk": 101,
  "pause_after": 0.365
 },
 {
  "text": "Only time can.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 285.655,
  "end": 286.545,
  "chunk": 102
 },
 {
  "text": "And conversation.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 286.545,
  "end": 287.138,
  "chunk": 102,
  "pause_after": 0.239
 },
 {
  "text": "In a world where we could see everyone's number, the smartest people would be the ones who stopped looking at it.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 287.377,
  "end": 291.045,
  "chunk": 103,
  "pause_after": 0.273
 },
 {
  "text": "Imagine a number floating above your head.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 291.318,
  "end": 292.641,
  "chunk": 104,
  "pause_after": 1.393
 },
 {
  "text": "What would you want people to ask you instead?",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 294.034,
  "end": 295.57,
  "chunk": 105,
  "pause_after": 2.0
 }
]